### MediFlow — Report service (qua gateway :8080) — live contract
###
### Quy ước nhánh C: report dùng tên field tiếng Anh (reportDate, departmentId, totalRevenue, ...).
###
### Trước khi chạy:
###  - eureka-server (8761) → gateway (8080) → report-service (8088) đang chạy.
###  - Có JWT:
###     IntelliJ: chạy backend/auth.http "Đăng nhập admin" → {{token}} tự được set global.
###     VS Code / Cursor: chạy auth.http, copy accessToken từ response, rồi bỏ comment
###       dòng "@token = ..." bên dưới và dán token vào.
###
### Endpoint theo spec 08-report.md (base /api/v1/reports) — role ADMIN/MANAGER:
###  - GET /daily?date&departmentId
###  - GET /monthly?month&year&departmentId
###  - GET /top-medicines?fromDate&toDate&departmentId&limit  (limit mặc định 10, tối đa 50)
###
### departmentId là tùy chọn ở cả ba: bỏ trống → số liệu toàn viện, truyền vào → của một khoa.
### Report là READ MODEL: ngày không có dữ liệu trả báo cáo toàn 0, KHÔNG trả 404 (BR-R5).
### Dữ liệu tổng hợp đến bất đồng bộ qua event: số 0 không chứng minh producer đã chạy,
### và 3 endpoint legacy chưa trả freshness/as-of. Không dùng số liệu này như quyết định điều trị.

@host = http://localhost:8080
# @token = paste-access-token-here

### Báo cáo khám theo ngày (toàn viện — bỏ departmentId)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/daily?date=2026-08-14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-daily-hospital-example

### Báo cáo khám theo ngày (của một khoa)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/daily?date=2026-08-14&departmentId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Báo cáo doanh thu tháng (toàn viện)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/monthly?month=8&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-monthly-example

### Báo cáo doanh thu tháng (của một khoa)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/monthly?month=8&year=2026&departmentId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Top thuốc xuất nhiều nhất trong khoảng ngày (toàn viện, mặc định limit 10)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/top-medicines?fromDate=2026-08-01&toDate=2026-08-14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-top-medicines-example

### Top thuốc theo khoa + giới hạn tùy chỉnh (tối đa 50)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/top-medicines?fromDate=2026-08-01&toDate=2026-08-14&departmentId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kiểm tra 401 qua Gateway: không gửi bearer token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/daily?date=2026-08-14
X-Correlation-Id: report-unauthorized-example

### Kiểm tra 403 qua Gateway: thay token bằng access token role DOCTOR
# @doctorToken = paste-doctor-access-token-here
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/daily?date=2026-08-14
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-forbidden-example

### V2 operations daily snapshot — ADMIN/MANAGER/DOCTOR
# Route exists ONLY with care-finance-v2=true (default false).
# No publication is created by migration/replay: enabled without accepted coverage -> 404 REPORT_NOT_FOUND.
# Hoang Anh still owns Gateway DOCTOR routing; do not enable flags or insert publication manually to bypass acceptance.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/operations/daily?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-02
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-operations-daily

### V2 surgery aggregate snapshot — ADMIN/MANAGER/DOCTOR
# Bounded inclusive period; response is snapshotOnly, not a live catch-up claim.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/operations/surgery?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-02
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-operations-surgery

### V2 financial daily — ADMIN/MANAGER ONLY, both care-finance-v2 and financial-read.enabled default false
# Empty/unaccepted/incomplete snapshots return 404 REPORT_NOT_FOUND, NOT successful zeroes.
# Use the separately gated, audited finite-source publisher below; never insert publication rows manually.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/daily?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-02
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-financial-daily

### V2 financial monthly — full year; flows sum, liability/receivable are each month's closing stocks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/monthly?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-financial-monthly

### Private management diagnostic — ADMIN/MANAGER access token only, NOT a Gateway API
# Default unavailable: telemetry=false and web exposure is health,info.
# Explicit telemetry opt-in PLUS private metrics exposure is required. Never expose this to patients.
# Gauge values are local diagnostics, not accepted source coverage or clinical/finance decisions.
@managementHost = http://localhost:8088
GET {{managementHost}}/actuator/metrics/report.telemetry.available
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Private aggregate pending diagnostic (same explicit management-plane opt-in)
GET {{managementHost}}/actuator/metrics/report.admission.pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sensitive local financial archive — ADMIN access token only; default OFF
# Requires both care-finance-v2 and financial-archive.enabled. Gateway ownership/rules are unchanged.
# A sealed V23 generation must already exist. Download contains exact minimal patient-reference evidence,
# not accepted historical coverage. Save only to encrypted, operator-controlled backup storage.
@archiveGenerationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/source-archives/{{archiveGenerationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: report-financial-source-export

### Restore saved LOCAL Report evidence into a new isolated generation — never publishes a report
# Replace the local input filename with the actual download. Never use test fixtures as production history.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/source-archives
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
X-Correlation-Id: report-financial-source-restore

< ./financial-source-archive.json

### Inspect supported source contracts — ADMIN, care-finance-v2 AND financial-publication.enabled (default OFF)
# New management-plane routes need separately reviewed Gateway POST policy. No Gateway change is made here.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicit history availability — ADMIN/MANAGER; unavailable history is metadata, never money=0
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/coverage?from=2026-10-09&to=2026-10-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Freeze supported LOCAL sources into an isolated generation — ADMIN, same publication gates
# Set from at/after the earliest retained source business day; older missing history cannot publish.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/rebuilds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-10-10","to":"2026-10-10"}

### Advance/reconcile a generation (1..31 completed days per transaction)
@financialGenerationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/rebuilds/{{financialGenerationId}}/batches?days=31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect durable bounded rebuild progress — ADMIN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/rebuilds/{{financialGenerationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publish VERIFIED all-five-metric snapshot — ADMIN signed access token UUID subject
# Replace manifestFingerprint with progress.manifestFingerprint, and commandId with a unique command UUID.
# expectedCurrentGenerationId=null is legal ONLY for the first publication. Later switch must provide current ID.
# Exact retry returns the original receipt without reverting a subsequent switch. New sources require a NEW freeze.
# AVAILABLE_EVIDENCE_ONLY explicitly excludes missing pre-V2 history; reference is a non-PII review/runbook ID.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/publications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"commandId":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101","generationId":"{{financialGenerationId}}","expectedCurrentGenerationId":null,"manifestFingerprint":"replace-with-exact-64-character-progress-hash","acceptanceReference":"review/financial-local-v1","historyPolicy":"AVAILABLE_EVIDENCE_ONLY"}

### Roll back pointer only to a previously accepted/published generation — ADMIN
# New command UUID and exact expected current pointer. This does not relabel older evidence fresh/current.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/financial/publications/rollbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"commandId":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102","generationId":"{{financialGenerationId}}","expectedCurrentGenerationId":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002","acceptanceReference":"rollback/financial-v1"}
